cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TDA on financial time series: regime change detection"
abstract: "Persistent homology over sliding windows of multi-asset returns, tested against realised volatility and the eigenvalue spectrum of the correlation matrix on leakage-free folds (purged walk-forward, leave-one-crisis-out). Version 0.2.0 adds the single run on market data of the analysis plan fixed in version 0.1.2, whose success criterion is not met, and analyses added after it, declared before they were computed: Monte Carlo tests of four statistics against synthetic null datasets, with their power on synthetic crises. They find no evidence on market data, with low power."
authors:
